            {"id": "obj_5p9a", "text": "Explain why the Technology pillar precedes Economics in the execution sequence"},
            {"id": "obj_5p9b", "text": "Distinguish what a claims database can prove from what a clinical exchange can prove, and name the blind spot each leaves"},
            {"id": "obj_5p9c", "text": "Identify the four structural limitations of an all-payer claims database used as a management tool"},
            {"id": "obj_5p9d", "text": "Diagnose the managing-blind failure mode in an organization that assumed downside risk ahead of its data capability"},
